# Project Context: Sanchit Singh Portfolio

## What This Project Does
Academic/research portfolio website for Sanchit Singh, showcasing publications, research projects, awards, gallery, and contact info.

## Tech Stack
- React 18, TypeScript, Vite
- Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui components
- Lucide React icons

## Key Files
| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| src/App.tsx | Main app layout, sections, content |
| src/components/layout/header.tsx | Nav, theme toggle, social links |
| src/components/theme-provider.tsx | Dark/light theme context and persistence |
| src/globals.css | CSS variables for light/dark themes |

